ersation Analytics Operational Recordings Operational Zoom Rooms Operational Zoom Rooms Operational Zoom Rooms Digital Signage Operational Zoom Workspace Reservation Operational Zoom Visitor Management Operational Zoom Subscriptions Operational Zoom Support Operational Knowledge Base Operational Chatbot Operational Ticketing Operational Phone Support Operational Zoom Virtual Agent Operational Zoom Website Operational Zoom Dashboard &amp; Reporting Operational Download Center &amp; Clients Operational Web Portal Operational Web Client Operational Zoom Rooms Operational Integrations/Calendar/Plug-In/Add-In Operational Zoom Learning Center Operational Zoom Workforce Management Operational Zoom Survey Operational Clinical Notes Operational Operational Degraded Performance Partial Outage Major Outage Maintenance Scheduled Maintenance Scheduled Zoom Software Quarterly Lifecycle Update (11/1/2025) Nov 1 , 2025 17:00 - 18:00 PDT The next Zoom Software Quarterly Lifecycle policy enforcement, scheduled for November 1, 2025, will maintain the same version requirements as the August 2025 enforcement for all clients and plugins, except for the Zoom Node - Conference Room Connector Hybrid. Zoom will be enforcing a new minimum version for Zoom Node - Conference Room Connector Hybrid, approximately 90 days from now on November 1, 2025. For more information, such as specific versions we are enforcing, refer to the Zoom Software Quarterly Lifecycle Policy support article: https://support.zoom.com/hc/en/article?id=zm_kb&amp;sysparm_article=KB0061130 To assist with checking the client versions on your account, refer to the Dashboard support article: https://support.zoom.com/hc/en/article?id=zm_kb&amp;sysparm_article=KB0062208#h_13ce9a73-91e5-4df6-9cb5-c815b1605cf5 Posted on Aug 01 , 2025 - 13:58 PDT Announcing IP Address Changes (No Operational Impact) Nov 22 , 2025 23:59 - Nov 23 , 2025 00:00 PST There are 3 changes as part of this announcement: a DNS change, an IP address change for Zoom Virtual Agent and Zoom Contact Center, and a protocol change for CDN. DNS Change Zoom will add an additional data center in an existing region to the global Zoom routing network, starting no earlier than 30 days from the posting of this notice. For network administrators with Zoom-specific proxy rules, please update your PAC files with the following site. New data centers: London (European Union) - lhr.zoom.us Additionally, the following data centers are no longer in use and will be removed from Zoom resources starting no earlier than 30 days from the posting of this notice: Removed data centers: New York (United States) - ny.zoom.us Denver (United States) - dv.zoom.us San Jose (United States) - sc.zoom.us San Jose (United States) - sj.zoom.us Toronto (Canada) - tr.zoom.us Vancouver (Canada) - vn.zoom.us Mexico (Latin America) - mx.zoom.us Leipzig (Europe) - lej.zoom.us Sydney (Australia) - sy.zoom.us Melbourne (Australia) - me.zoom.us Osaka (Japan) - os.zoom.us Tokyo (Japan) - ty.zoom.us These changes will not affect Data &amp; Storage Settings within the web portal concerning regions selected for Real-time data center locations. This is only a notification about the addition of data centers, their applicable DNS, and IP addresses within the existing regions. A complete list of Zoom data centers can be found on the Zoom Support site at: https://support.zoom.com/hc/en/article?id=zm_kb&amp;sysparm_article=KB0067446 IP Address Changes In addition to the data center changes, the following new and updated IP subnet ranges will be deployed to Zoom resources for the Zoom Contact Center (ZCC) Flow Script and HTTP Call widgets, as well as the Zoom Virtual Agent (ZVA) HTTP call widget, AI expert assist, and knowledge base sync endpoints. New IPv4 addresses for the ZCC Flow Script widget and HTTP Call widget endpoints: 3.9.26.103 3.9.162.31 13.43.145.150 13.134.72.26 129.80.58.73 137.131.11.103 New IPv4 addresses for the ZVA HTTP call widget, AI expert assist, and knowledge base sync endpoints: 18.169.204.204 18.171.24.214 35.176.112.167 35.179.65.194 Protocol Change Finally, the table for CDN rules has been updated to include the use of the UDP and TCP protocols for HTTP/HTTPS and HTTP/3 delivery. Due to this, we recommend that network administrators, with Zoom-specific firewall or network rules, update their systems. This update is only for the protocol; no changes have been made to the destination addresses used for CDN. A complete list of network firewall IP ranges for Zoom can be found on the Zoom Support site at: https://support.zoom.com/hc/en/article?id=zm_kb&amp;sysparm_article=KB0060548 Posted on Oct 20 , 2025 - 14:12 PDT Zoom Support Maintenance Dec 12 , 2025 16:00 - 20:00 PST We will be performing maintenance on Zoom Support Ticketing and Knowledge Base. Users may experience degraded performance and up to 30 minutes of downtime for Zoom Support’s Knowledge Base and Ticketing during the maintenance window. Posted on Oct 18 , 2025 - 08:32 PDT Past Incidents Oct 23 , 2025 No incidents reported today. Oct 22 , 2025 Unresolved incident: Some meeting summaries that were captured during the October 20 outage may be delayed in their delivery. Oct 21 , 2025 Oct 20 , 2025 Issue with Zoom AIC, Zoom Learning Center &amp;amp; push notifications services Resolved - This incident has been resolved. Oct 20 , 17:06 PDT Monitoring - Zoom Learning Center service has been restored. Oct 20 , 15:22 PDT Update - Zoom Chat messaging, history, channels and push notifications are restored. Oct 20 , 12:49 PDT Update - Zoom AI Companion meeting questions has been restored. Other services are still recovering. Oct 20 , 11:33 PDT Update - We have identified the issue with subset of users are experiencing issues with AIC, Zoom learning center,ZCC and push notifications services. Zoom will provide updates as we have them. Oct 20 , 08:29 PDT Update - We have identified the issue with subset of users are experiencing issues with AIC, Zoom learning center and push notifications services. Zoom will provide updates as we have them. Oct 20 , 07:27 PDT Identified - We have identified the issue with subset of users are experiencing issues with AIC and push notifications services. Zoom will provide updates as we have them. Oct 20 , 07:22 PDT Update - We have identified the issue with subset of users are experiencing issues with AIC and push notifications services. Zoom will provide updates as we have them. Oct 20 , 07:15 PDT Investigating - A subset of users are experiencing issues with AIC and push notifications services. Zoom will provide updates as soon as there is more information to share. Oct 20 , 06:49 PDT Issue with Zoom Services Resolved - This incident has been resolved. Oct 20 , 15:22 PDT Monitoring - All services under this status post have been resolved and we are continuing to monitor services. Oct 20 , 13:37 PDT Update - Zoom Chat, Clinical Notes and Zoom Survey have now been restored. The team is continuing to work on restoration for the remaining service and will update as soon as we have new information to share. Oct 20 , 13:00 PDT Update - Zoom has restored multiple services and continues to work on restoration for the remaining services. Note that some meeting summaries generated by AI Companion during the initial incident are delayed and will be delivered later today. Oct 20 , 12:57 PDT Update - Zoom Revenue Accelerator service has been restored. The team is still working on restoring service for other services. Oct 20 , 12:07 PDT Update - We are continuing to work on a fix for this issue. Oct 20 , 11:57 PDT Identified - Our vendor has experienced a further service degradation and we are currently taking steps to mitigate. Oct 20 , 10:52 PDT Monitoring - Our vendor has resolved the issue. We will continue to monitor and provide updates as we have them. Oct 20 , 03:52 PDT Update - We are working with the vendor to resolve the issue. We will continue to provide updates as we have them. Oct 20 , 03:45 PDT Identified - We have identified the issue causing Zoom services degradation. Our engineers are currently working on the fix. Zoom will provide updates as soon as there is more information to share. Oct 20 , 02:13 PDT Update - We are continuing to investigate the issue. We will continue to provide updates as we have them. Oct 20 , 01:37 PDT Update - We are continuing to investigate the issue. We will continue to provide updates as we have them. Oct 20 , 00:58 PDT Investigating - We have identified an issue with Zoom services degradation and are working on a mitigation plan. We will continue to provide updates as we have them. Oct 20 , 00:35 PDT Oct 19 , 2025 Zoom Workforce Management Update: 10/19/2025 (No Operational Impact) Completed - The scheduled maintenance has been completed. Oct 19 , 02:00 PDT In progress - Scheduled maintenance is currently in progress. We will provide updates as necessary. Oct 18 , 17:00 PDT Scheduled - We will be providing an update to Zoom Workforce Management. Please refer to https://support.zoom.com/hc/en/article?id=zm_kb&amp;sysparm_article=KB0068337 for more details. This update includes support for the Agent board. There is no operational impact. All services will be available during this scheduled update. Oct 13 , 11:59 PDT Zoom Phone Update: 10/19/2025 (No Operational Impact) Completed - The scheduled maintenance has been completed. Oct 19 , 02:00 PDT In progress - Scheduled maintenance is currently in progress. We will provide updates as necessary. Oct 18 , 17:00 PDT Scheduled - We will be providing an update to Zoom Phone. Please refer to https://support.zoom.com/hc/en/article?id=zm_kb&amp;sysparm_article=KB0062333 for more details. This update includes support for Zoom Phone AI and expanded transcription language options. There is no operational impact. All services will be available during this scheduled update. For Japan SIP zones in Tokyo and Osaka, there is a separate maintenance window: 10/19/2025 8:00AM - 10:00AM PDT (10/20/2025 00:00 - 2:00 JST). Oct 12 , 08:16 PDT Oct 18 , 2025 A subset of users are experiencing issues with Workforce Management in certain US regions. Resolved - This incident has been resolved. Oct 18 , 19:41 PDT Monitoring - We have fixed the issue where a subset of users were experiencing some issue with Workforce Management for certain US regions. We will continue to monitor and provide updates as soon as there is more information to share. Oct 18 , 19:24 PDT Investigating - We have detected service degradation where a subset of users would be experiencing some issue in Workforce Management for few US regions. Our engineers are currently investigating the impact and root cause. Zoom will provide updates as soon as there is more information to share. Oct 18 , 19:23 PDT Zoom Support Maintenance Completed - The scheduled maintenance has been completed. Oct 18 , 07:30 PDT In progress - Scheduled maintenance is currently in progress. We will provide updates as necessary. Oct 18 , 05:30 PDT Scheduled - We will be performing maintenance on Zoom Support Ticketing and Knowledge Base. Downtime is not expected, but users may experience general slowness for Zoom Support Knowledge Base and Ticketing during the maintenance window. Oct 10 , 13:46 PDT Zoom Support EU Maintenance Completed - The scheduled maintenance has been completed. Oct 18 , 07:30 PDT In progress - Scheduled maintenance is currently in progress. We will provide updates as necessary. Oct 18 , 05:30 PDT Scheduled - We will be performing maintenance on Zoom Support EU Ticketing and Knowledge Base. Downtime is not expected, but users may experience general slowness for Zoom Support’s EU Knowledge Base and Ticketing during the maintenance window. Oct 10 , 13:39 PDT Zoom Virtual Agent Update: 10/18/2025 (No Operational Impact) Completed - The scheduled maintenance has been completed. Oct 18 , 02:00 PDT In progress - Scheduled maintenance is currently in progress. We will provide updates as necessary. Oct 17 , 17:00 PDT Scheduled - We will be providing an update to Zoom Virtual Agent. Please refer to https://support.zoom.com/hc/en/article?id=zm_kb&amp;sysparm_article=KB0067812 for more details. This update includes voice cloning capabilities for creating custom brand voices. There is no operational impact. All services will be available during this scheduled update. Oct 13 , 09:51 PDT Zoom Contact Center Update: 10/18/2025 (No Operational Impact) Completed - The scheduled maintenance has been completed. Oct 18 , 02:00 PDT In progress - Scheduled maintenance is currently in progress. We will provide updates as necessary. Oct 17 , 17:00 PDT Scheduled - We will be providing an update to Zoom Contact Center. Please refer to https://support.zoom.com/hc/en/article?id=zm_kb&amp;sysparm_article=KB0067626 for more details. This update includes a new route to callback option for handling queue overflow. There is no operational impact. All services will be available during this scheduled update. Oct 13 , 09:47 PDT Oct 17 , 2025 A subset of users experiencing issues while sending emails through Zoom Mail. Resolved - This incident has been resolved. Oct 17 , 21:05 PDT Monitoring - We have fixed the issue where a subset of users were experiencing issues while sending emails through Zoom Mail. We will continue to monitor and provide updates as soon as there is more information to share. Oct 17 , 20:50 PDT Identified - We have identified the cause for service degradation where a subset of users would be experiencing issues while sending emails through Zoom Mail. Our engineers are currently working on the fix. Zoom will provide updates as soon as there is more information is available. Oct 17 , 19:48 PDT Investigating - We have detected service degradation where a subset of users would be experiencing issues while sending emails through Zoom Mail. Our engineers are currently investigating the impact and root cause. Zoom will provide updates as soon as there is more information to share. Oct 17 , 19:43 PDT A subset of users are experiencing delays in sending and receiving Zoom messages. Resolved - On 10/17, between 5:35 UTC and 6:27 UTC, a subset of users experienced delays in sending and receiving messages on Zoom Chat, and presence of Zoom Chat and Zoom Rooms were impacted. The issue has been resolved. Oct 17 , 00:00 PDT Monitoring - We have fixed the issue where a subset of users were experiencing delays in sending and receiving Zoom messages. We will continue to monitor and provide updates as soon as there is more information to share. Oct 16 , 23:39 PDT Identified - We have identified the cause for service degradation where a subset of users would be experiencing delays in sending and receiving Zoom messages. Our engineers are currently working on the fix. Zoom will provide updates as soon as there is more information to share. Oct 16 , 23:29 PDT Investigating - We have detected service degradation where a subset of users would be experiencing delays in sending and receiving Zoom messages. Our engineers are currently investigating the impact and root cause. Zoom will provide updates as soon as there is more information to share. Oct 16 , 23:20 PDT Oct 16 , 2025 Temporary Unavailability of Our Indian Support Number Completed - The scheduled maintenance has been completed. Oct 16 , 11:30 PDT In progress - Scheduled maintenance is currently in progress. We will provide updates as necessary. Oct 16 , 10:30 PDT Scheduled - We will be performing a planned site migration and our main Indian phone support number may be temporarily unavailable during this period. We encourage our Indian customers to reach us through our alternative support channels — including chat and web — to ensure uninterrupted assistance. Thank you for your understanding and continued support. Oct 15 , 14:21 PDT Oct 15 , 2025 Scheduled Update to Slow versions for Clients: October 15, 2025 Completed - The scheduled maintenance has been completed. Oct 15 , 21:00 PDT In progress - Scheduled maintenance is currently in progress. We will provide updates as necessary. Oct 15 , 18:00 PDT Scheduled - Zoom will be updating the Slow track versions for Zoom clients on October 15, 2025. Slow Channel Updates: Windows: 6.5.12 macOS: 6.5.12 Linux: 6.5.11 Windows (VDI): 6.3.15 For more information, such as specific versions, please refer to the Zoom Minimum, Prompted, and Slow/Fast Update Versions support article: https://support.zoom.com/hc/en/article?id=zm_kb&amp;sysparm_article=KB0061900 Oct 10 , 10:28 PDT A subset of users may experience issues with Zoom Phone inbound calls in South Africa region Resolved - This incident has been resolved. Oct 15 , 11:10 PDT Monitoring - We have resolved the issue causing service degradation where subset of users would be experienced issues with Zoom Phone inbound calls in South Africa region. We will continue to monitor and provide updates as we have them. Oct 15 , 10:58 PDT Update - We continue to work on a fix for this issue &amp; will provide updates as soon as there is more information to share. Oct 15 , 08:30 PDT Identified - We have identified the issue causing service degradation where subset of users would be experiencing issues with Zoom Phone inbound calls in South Africa region. We will continue to provide updates as we have them. Oct 15 , 05:04 PDT Investigating - We have detected service degradation where a subset of users may experience issues with Zoom Phone inbound calls in South Africa region. Our engineers are currently investigating the impact and root cause. Zoom will provide updates as soon as there is more information to share. Oct 15 , 03:43 PDT Oct 14 , 2025 No incidents reported. Oct 13 , 2025 No incidents reported. Oct 12 , 2025 No incidents reported. Oct 11 , 2025 No incidents reported. Oct 10 , 2025 Zoom Support EU Maintenance Completed - The scheduled maintenance has been completed. Oct 10 , 15:00 PDT In progress - Scheduled maintenance is currently in progress. We will provide updates as necessary. Oct 10 , 14:00 PDT Scheduled - We will be performing maintenance on Zoom Support EU Ticketing and Knowledge Base. Users may experience degraded performance and up to 60 minutes of downtime for Zoom Support’s EU Knowledge Base and Ticketing during the maintenance window. Oct 9 , 09:59 PDT Issues with Zoom Meeting AIC services in North America and Europe region. Resolved - This incident has been resolved. Oct 10 , 02:50 PDT Monitoring - Between 2025-10-10 08:31 UTC to 2025-10-10 09:05 UTC, users were getting error while generating AI meeting summary. We have resolved the issue. Zoom will continue to monitor and provide updates as we have them. Oct 10 , 02:11 PDT Investigating - Our monitoring has detected service degradation with users are getting error while generating AI meeting summary. Our engineers are currently investigating the impact and root cause. Zoom will provide updates as soon as there is more information to share. Oct 10 , 01:53 PDT Oct 9 , 2025 No incidents reported. &amp;larr; Incident History Powered by Atlassian Statuspage</code></pre>
